# MASTER BUILD BLUEPRINT
# CREATIVE ARCHITECT AI
## AI Creative Art Director, Graphic Designer and Editable Artwork Production Studio

Build a complete, working, full-stack web application named **CREATIVE ARCHITECT AI**.

This must be an operational design application, not a static dashboard, landing page, chatbot mockup or UI-only prototype.

The application must combine multimodal AI analysis, reference-based design intelligence, creative direction, structured prompt engineering, editable SVG generation, PDF export, artwork inspection and quality assurance.

The target user is a professional graphic designer and creative consultant producing premium advertising, pharmaceutical communications, healthcare campaigns, brochures, product labels, posters and brand assets.

The application must prioritise professional art direction, exact content, asset integrity, editable deliverables and reliable production.

Build the application in a modular, maintainable architecture. Implement the core functionality end to end before adding optional features.

